h each cell row is removed, saving roughly 22 dp of vertical space per row so more cells fit on screen."}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_cell_table_arfcn_bw", "label": "NR-SA cell table \u2014 ARFCN and bandwidth columns", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Row heights are reduced (top row 28 dp to 22 dp, child rows 26 dp to 21 dp) and the redundant sub-row is hidden so more rows fit on screen."}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_lte_cell_table_bw_column", "label": "LTE cell table \u2014 bandwidth column", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_nsa_16_cell_table", "label": "NR-NSA 16-cell table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_lte_16_cell_table", "label": "LTE 16-cell table", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_ca_matrix_enhancements_dl", "label": "CA Matrix Enhancements (DL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_lte_ca_matrix_dl_rsrp_row", "label": "LTE CA Matrix DL \u2014 RSRP row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_nsa_eutra_ca_matrix_dl_rsrp_row", "label": "NR-NSA EUTRA CA Matrix DL \u2014 RSRP row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_ca_matrix_dl_ss_csi_rsrp_rows", "label": "NR-SA CA Matrix DL \u2014 SS-RSRP and CSI-RSRP rows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_ca_matrix_dl_csi_snr_row", "label": "NR-SA CA Matrix DL \u2014 CSI SNR row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_ca_matrix_dl_modulation_utilisation_rows", "label": "NR-SA CA Matrix DL \u2014 16QAM and QPSK utilisation rows", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_ca_matrix_dl_per_scell_colour_coding", "label": "NR-SA CA Matrix DL \u2014 per-SCell colour coding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_ca_matrix_dl_carrier_count_fix", "label": "NR-SA CA Matrix DL \u2014 carrier count indicator fix", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NSG's NR_CarrierCount property has no data in NR-SA mode, so the hook computes the actual carrier count from SCell ARFCN/PCI arrays in the Workspace."}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_ca_matrix_dl_honest_mimo", "label": "NR-SA CA Matrix DL \u2014 honest MIMO format", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "NSG's default hardcodes symmetric NxN strings which misleadingly implies gNB TX knowledge; the hook displays only what is known, using the actual NR_PCell_Num_CSI_Ports value for the PCell TX side."}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_ca_matrix_enhancements_ul", "label": "CA Matrix Enhancements (UL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_ca_matrix_ul_pucch_tx", "label": "NR-SA CA Matrix UL \u2014 PUCCH TX power row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_nr_sa_status_panel_bwp_id", "label": "NR-SA status panel \u2014 BWP-ID column", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_lte_ca_matrix_ul_qpsk_utilisation", "label": "LTE CA Matrix UL \u2014 QPSK utilisation row", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_signaling_tab", "label": "Signaling Tab", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_signaling_search_bar", "label": "Search bar in message detail", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Search runs on a background thread to keep the UI responsive on long messages, and results are capped at 200 matches to preserve responsiveness."}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_signaling_share_button", "label": "Share button", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_signaling_scroll_bar", "label": "Scroll bar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_log_replay", "label": "Log Replay", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_replay_status_bar", "label": "Replay status bar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_real_time_playback_button", "label": "Real-time playback button", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_granular_seekbar", "label": "Granular seekbar", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_cell_database", "label": "Cell Database", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_lte_cell_lookup_cellid", "label": "LTE cell lookup \u2014 match by CellID instead of PCI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two physically adjacent cells can share the same PCI on the same frequency, leading to false matches; EARFCN + ECellID is globally unique so the correct record is retrieved, with PCI matching as a fallback."}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_performance", "label": "Performance", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_fast_refresh_toggle", "label": "Fast refresh toggle", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Doubles the UI refresh rate from 880 ms to 440 ms by intercepting t7.g0.E() and rescheduling the ScheduledFuture; the native modem data collection rate remains the real bottleneck, so this only polls cached data faster."}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_settings", "label": "Settings", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_toggle_cell_table_mods", "label": "NSGMod: Cell table mods", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_toggle_rt_play", "label": "NSGMod: RT-Play button", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "nsg_band_hook_readme_toggle_use_cellid", "label": "NSGMod: Use CellID instead of PCI", "file_type": "